      "excerpt": "# Budget Planning\n\nBloom & Brew's budget is managed on a quarterly cycle, with monthly check-ins to track actuals against projections.\n\n## Annual Budget Overview\n\n| Category | Annual Budget | % of Revenue |\n|----------|--------------|-------------|\n| Cost of Goods (Coffee) | $85,000 | 22% |\n| Cost of Goods (Floral) | $62,000 | 16% |\n| Payroll & Benefits | $145,000 | 38% |\n| Rent & Facilities | $42,000 | 11% |\n| Marketing | $18,000 | 5% |\n| Technology | $4,800 | 1.2% |\n| Insurance & Legal | $8,500 | 2.2% |\n| Miscellaneous | $12,000 | 3% |\n\n## Budget Process\n\n1. Department leads submit requests by the 15th of the month before quarter start\n2. Owner reviews and adjusts based on [[Revenue Streams]] projections\n3. Final budget approved at [[Quarterly Business Review]]\n4. Monthly actuals tracked in our accounting spreadsheet (see [[Tech Stack and Tools]])\n\n## Key Budget Items for Next Quarter\n\n- [[Shift Scheduling]] software upgrade: $50/month\n- [[Social Media Strategy]] ad spend increase: +$500/month for [[Seasonal Campaigns]]\n- [[Facilities Maintenance]] patio expansion deposit: $5,000\n- [[Training and Onboarding]] materials update: $800\n- [[Email Marketing]] Mailchimp upgrade: $20/month\n\n## Financial Controls\n\n- All purchases over $200 require owner approval\n- [[Inventory Management]] waste is tracked against budget weekly\n- [[Supplier Relationships]] terms are renegotiated annually\n- Emergency fund: 2 months of operating expenses maintained\n\n## Reporting\n\nMonthly P&L is reviewed by ownership. Quarterly financial summary is presented at [[Quarterly Business Review]] alongside [[Revenue Streams]] performance and [[Growth Roadmap]] investment tracking.\n"
