      "excerpt": "# Growth Roadmap\n\nThis document outlines Bloom & Brew's strategic growth plan for the next 18 months. Our goal is to grow revenue by 40% while maintaining the intimate, community feel that makes us special.\n\n## Phase 1: Foundation (Current - Q1 Next Year)\n\n### Optimize Existing Operations\n- Streamline [[Inventory Management]] to reduce waste below 5%\n- Implement proper [[Shift Scheduling]] software\n- Upgrade [[Tech Stack and Tools]] for better data tracking\n- Strengthen [[Supplier Relationships]] with volume commitments\n\n### Grow Digital Presence\n- Double [[Social Media Strategy]] following (target: 15K Instagram)\n- Grow [[Email Marketing]] list to 6,000 subscribers\n- Launch online ordering for arrangements and coffee subscriptions\n\n## Phase 2: Expansion (Q2 - Q3 Next Year)\n\n### Physical Expansion\n- Patio build-out for outdoor seating and events (see [[Facilities Maintenance]])\n- Add a small event space for private workshops and parties\n- [[Budget Planning]] includes $25,000 capital allocation\n\n### Revenue Diversification\n- Launch corporate gifting program via [[Partnership Opportunities]]\n- Introduce DIY arrangement kits for shipping (new [[Product Catalog]] line)\n- Expand workshop offerings (coffee cupping, latte art, wreath making)\n\n## Phase 3: Scale (Q4 Next Year and Beyond)\n\n### Big Moves\n- Evaluate second location feasibility\n- Franchise model research\n- Wholesale private-label coffee program\n- E-commerce expansion\n\n## Success Metrics\n\nAll tracked in [[Quarterly Business Review]]:\n- Revenue growth: 40% over 18 months\n- Customer retention: maintain 75%+ via [[Loyalty Program]]\n- Net promoter score: 70+ via [[Customer Feedback Program]]\n- Team satisfaction: 4.5/5 via [[Employee Wellness Program]] surveys\n- [[Revenue Streams]] diversification: no single stream > 30%\n\n## Investment Needed\n\nDetailed in [[Budget Planning]]. Total Phase 1-2 investment: ~$45,000, funded from operations and a small business line of credit.\n"
