      "excerpt": "# Brand Guidelines\n\nBloom & Brew's brand identity reflects the intersection of artisan coffee culture and botanical beauty. Every touchpoint should feel warm, organic, and slightly luxurious.\n\n## Brand Essence\n\n**Tagline:** \"Where Coffee Meets Flowers\"\n**Mission:** To create a sensory sanctuary where the ritual of great coffee and the beauty of fresh flowers elevate everyday moments.\n\n## Visual Identity\n\n### Colors\n- Primary: Deep Forest Green (#2D5016) and Warm Cream (#F5F0E8)\n- Secondary: Terracotta (#C4703F), Dusty Rose (#C9929B), Coffee Brown (#6F4E37)\n- Accent: Gold (#C5A55A) for premium elements\n\n### Typography\n- Headlines: Playfair Display (serif, elegant)\n- Body: Inter (clean, readable)\n- Accent: Sacramento (script, for special callouts)\n\n### Photography Style\n- Natural lighting preferred\n- Warm, slightly desaturated tones\n- Show real people, real moments \u2014 nothing overly staged\n- Always include either coffee or flowers (or both) in frame\n\n## Voice & Tone\n\n- Warm and welcoming, never pretentious\n- Knowledgeable but approachable\n- We say \"studio\" not \"shop\" \u2014 it reflects our craft approach\n- First-person plural (\"we\") in all brand communications\n\n## Applications\n\nThese guidelines apply across [[Social Media Strategy]], [[Email Marketing]], our [[Product Catalog]] photography, and physical signage. All [[Seasonal Campaigns]] materials must be reviewed for brand compliance.\n\nThe [[Partnership Opportunities]] document includes co-branding requirements for collaborations.\n"
