      "is_hub": false,
      "excerpt": "# Facilities Maintenance\n\nOur space at 412 Magnolia Avenue is a converted 1920s brick warehouse \u2014 beautiful, but it needs consistent upkeep. Maintaining the aesthetic is key to our [[Brand Guidelines]] and customer experience.\n\n## Daily Tasks\n\n- [ ] Sweep and mop all floors (hardwood in caf\u00e9, tile in workshop)\n- [ ] Clean espresso machines and grinders (see [[Product Catalog]] for equipment list)\n- [ ] Wipe down all display surfaces and the floral cooler glass\n- [ ] Empty compost bins (coffee grounds + floral waste go to our partner garden)\n- [ ] Check cold storage temperatures and log in [[Inventory Management]] sheet\n\n## Weekly Tasks\n\n- Deep clean restrooms\n- Polish brass fixtures and vintage signage\n- Water the living wall installation\n- Clean exterior windows and sweep the patio seating area\n\n## Monthly Tasks\n\n- HVAC filter replacement\n- Pest control inspection\n- Grease trap cleaning\n- Review [[Budget Planning]] for any upcoming capital maintenance needs\n\n## Vendor Contacts\n\nAll maintenance vendor information is stored in the [[Supplier Relationships]] file. Our landlord handles structural issues but we're responsible for interior maintenance per our lease terms.\n\n## Renovation Plans\n\nWe're planning a patio expansion for Q2 next year. This ties into our [[Growth Roadmap]] and the [[Revenue Streams]] goal of adding outdoor event hosting. The [[Quarterly Business Review]] will include construction timeline updates.\n"
